      "value": "Why can’t I block a whole world? I’m addicted to this world the people are great. I just don’t wanna play in this world anymore and I don’t wanna see it because every time I see it I go in there. It’s called VR poker so and it’s addicting I should be able to block a world and not see it in my searches.",
