  "details": "You can block worlds (similarly to how you can block a user).  People can't invite you to a world, with a popup saying \"User cannot be invited. They have blocked this world\".\n\nIt's very useful so people can invite you to other worlds, but they can't invite you to specific worlds. Even if they try to spam invite you, they can't invite you to a blocked world.",
